&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Content Creator - Content Creation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior AI Content Creator in the HelloFresh Studio, you are part of the AI Content Creation team and play a leading role in developing and scaling AI-powered content creation across mainly photography, but also supporting video, design, and emerging creative formats.&lt;/p&gt;
