&lt;p&gt;The Consumer Bank squad sits at the heart of one of SumUp&#39;s most exciting growth bets — scaling SumUp Pay, our consumer fintech product, to millions of active users across Europe. The team owns end-to-end UX and product design across the full user lifecycle, from onboarding and activation through to engagement features like Spaces, Open Banking insights, and budget tracking. This is a high-craft, high-autonomy environment where design isn&#39;t just execution — it&#39;s central to defining the problems worth solving, and your work will directly shape adoption, retention, and the future of SumUp&#39;s consumer offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end product design within the Consumer Bank squad, from discovery through to delivery, across the SumUp Pay mobile experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery by identifying user problems, framing opportunities, and shaping hypotheses alongside Product and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design intuitive, high-quality mobile experiences in Figma that drive key metrics including activation, engagement, and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate solutions through prototyping, user research, and usability testing, using both qualitative and quantitative data to iterate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design system and help maintain consistency and quality across the product as SumUp scales its consumer offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
